doubling map x->2x : CRT view of n=14 = 2*7
  binder 1 mod 14 = (1 mod 2, 1 mod 7)
  mod 2 coord under x->2x: [1, 0, 0] (1->0 collapse, irreversible)
  mod 7 coord under x->2x: [1, 2, 4, 1] (clean order-3 cycle 1->2->4->1)

odd-n regularity: # of cyclic components of x->2x mod n on 1..n-1
   n= 7: 2 mod n invertible
   n= 9: 2 mod n invertible
   n=11: 2 mod n invertible
   n=13: 2 mod n invertible
   n=14: 2 mod n DEGENERATE(2|n)
   n=15: 2 mod n invertible
   n=16: 2 mod n DEGENERATE(2|n)
   n=12: 2 mod n DEGENERATE(2|n)
   n=10: 2 mod n DEGENERATE(2|n)
